  case_raise stdout | first: the case ran to completion (raised Failure("boom")): false
  case_raise stdout | second: reached: true
  case_raise stderr | FAIL: first: the case ran to completion (raised Failure("boom")): false
  case_raise stderr | FAILED: 1 check did not hold: "first: the case ran to completion".
  case_exit stdout | the claim: false
  case_exit stderr | FAIL: the claim: false
  case_exit stderr | FAILED: 1 check did not hold: "the claim".
  case_exit stderr | STOPPED EARLY: an exit inside case "exits" ended the run, so no case after it ran
  trailer_omitted stdout | first claim: false
  trailer_omitted stdout | FAIL: second claim
  trailer_omitted stdout | FAIL:   expected a, got b
  trailer_omitted stdout | third claim: false
  trailer_omitted stdout | last claim: true
  trailer_omitted stderr | FAIL: first claim: false
  trailer_omitted stderr | FAIL: second claim
  trailer_omitted stderr | FAIL:   expected a, got b
  trailer_omitted stderr | FAIL: third claim: false
  trailer_omitted stderr | FAILED: 3 checks did not hold: "first claim", "second claim", "third claim".
  pass_fail_forms stdout | held: PASS
  pass_fail_forms stdout | failed: FAIL
  pass_fail_forms stdout | FAIL: a message, not a claim
  pass_fail_forms stdout | detailed: FAIL (got 1 want 2)
  pass_fail_forms stderr | FAIL: failed: FAIL
  pass_fail_forms stderr | FAIL: a message, not a claim
  pass_fail_forms stderr | FAIL: detailed: FAIL (got 1 want 2)
